huhqueue/connectors/linkedin.py  (modified / ported to Python)
  Source:   coollabsio/shoutrrr - app/Services/Publishing/Connectors/LinkedInConnector.php,
            LinkedInOrgResolver.php, config/services.php
            https://github.com/coollabsio/shoutrrr
  Licence:  Apache License 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)
  What:     the two-app model (OpenID personal app + separate Community Management API app for pages), the
            configurable LinkedIn-Version header, commentary escaping that keeps mentions and hashtags,
            per-image alt text, byte-range video upload with finalize + readiness wait, link previews built
            from the page's Open Graph tags, and HTTP status -> error-class mapping honouring Retry-After.
            Re-implemented in Python for HuhQueue's connector contract; changed throughout.

web/src/components/ImageEditor.jsx  (library dependency, bundled into huhqueue/static/app)
  Source:   ValentinH/react-easy-crop  https://github.com/ValentinH/react-easy-crop
  Licence:  MIT
  What:     the crop / zoom / rotate widget, used as an npm dependency (unmodified). The flip transform and the
            server-side pixel pipeline (huhqueue/services/image_edit.py, Pillow) are our own.

huhqueue/services/growth.py  CSV bulk upload (Buffer parity)
  Ideas only: Buffer's public help article on bulk upload (column names and Posting Time format). No code.

huhqueue/static/bio/brands.css, huhqueue/static/bio/icons/*.svg, huhqueue/static/bio/brands.json  (copied)
  Source:   sethcottle/littlelink @ 3c9162c9f8324d5e002259ed8b4b3cc377b08486 - css/brands.css, images/icons/*.svg,
            and the brand key / icon / label list read from index.html
            https://github.com/sethcottle/littlelink
  Licence:  MIT (full text in huhqueue/static/bio/LICENSE-littlelink.md), Copyright 2019-2024 Seth Cottle
  What:     93 brand button colour rules and 123 SVG icons, unmodified. brands.json is generated from LittleLink's
            index.html (modified: data format only). The CSS is inlined per page by huhqueue/services/bio.py.
            Brand names and logos remain trademarks of their respective owners.

huhqueue/services/bio.py  (library dependency)
  QR codes use segno (BSD-3-Clause, https://github.com/heuer/segno) as a library.

